# RB-CHAT

A modern real-time chat application built with the MERN Stack.

## Features
- Real-time messaging
- JWT Authentication
- Online/Offline status
- Typing indicators
- Image & file sharing
- Responsive design

## Tech Stack
- React + Vite
- Node.js
- Express.js
- MongoDB Atlas
- Socket.IO
- Tailwind CSS
- Cloudinary

## Installation

1. Clone the repository
2. Install dependencies
3. Configure the .env file
4. Run the frontend and backend

